  "note": "R3 (4 Nov 2026, the user): every design value lives in hsb_app/docs/redesign/qa/tokens.json, edited only by UI Designer 1, and reaches Loyalty through tokens/hsb-tokens.css, a byte-equal copy (sh tools/check-tokens.sh). This file only names Loyalty's older variables; build.py writes tokens/tokens.css from it.",
